      "id": "claim_d499934f3e6744d097f1cc8b54ba2f93",
      "statement": "MDL-CAP-003 is a Tier 1 Excel model owned by Corporate Treasury - Capital Management and independently validated by MRGR (last validation 2026-02-27, next due 2027-02-28). It projects CET1 capital, RWA and ratios over nine quarters (Q3 2026 to Q3 2028) from Q2 2026 actuals under baseline and severely adverse scenarios to size distributions.",
