      "statement": "Starting CET1 capital (101,200) and standardized RWA (668,400) come from API-16 Regulatory Reporting API, stress scenario paths from API-14 Macroeconomic Scenario API, and distribution liquidity constraints are cross-checked against API-15; the distribution plan is approved by the Board Capital Committee. Outputs feed the Annual Report (Capital Risk Management) and Pillar 3 (Capital Planning and Stress Testing).",
